1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,680
Reading: Letter to Friend.

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:18,800
Hanoi, August 5, 2020.

3
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:23,420
Dear Hong,

4
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:30,710
I am Nguyen Minh Phuong

5
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:52,710
I am Nguyen Minh Phuong, student of class 4A1 Ly Thai To Elementary School, Hanoi.

6
00:00:53,970 --> 00:01:06,170
Today reading newspaper, I learned your family's house was washed away by flood.

7
00:01:07,110 --> 00:01:16,440
I write this letter to ask about you and your family.

8
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:33,640
I send you a small amount of money I saved from breakfast money, for you to buy study supplies.

9
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:42,130
Please accept!

10
00:01:42,130 --> 00:01:52,550
Hope you and family soon overcome difficulties.

11
00:01:52,550 --> 00:01:59,930
Wish you healthy, study well.

12
00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:20,350
Your friend Nguyen Minh Phuong.

